{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42297","headline":"和尉迟赞善秋暮僻居 · 徐铉","name":"和尉迟赞善秋暮僻居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登高节物最堪怜，小岭疎林对槛前。\n轻吹断时云缥缈，夕阳明处水澄鲜。\n江城秋早催寒事，望苑朝稀足晏眠。\n庭有菊花尊有酒，若方陶令媿前贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}